+// REWINDBOX_THERMAL_POLICY_931 (IOSThermalPolicy931.h): one exclusive-monitor wait. LDAXR arms the monitor on the
+// watched word's line; if the word still holds `seen`, WFE halts the core (clock-gated) until a write by another
+// core to that line clears the monitor, an interrupt arrives, or the event stream XNU enables as the WFE timeout
+// fires; CLREX then drops the monitor. A word that changed since `seen` was read returns at once. The caller keeps its
+// loop: it tests its condition again after every call, so a spurious wake (another field of the same line written)
